  {
   "id": "tearscape-318752@1.1.0",
   "gameId": "tearscape-318752",
   "displayName": "Update 1.1.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-03-04T15:33:44.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "small change to how the purple block pattern puzzle works (read notes below)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed tears dropping and immediately disappearing on death in some rare cases",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed cycling tools not working correctly sometimes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "reworked how most screens work so they should open a bit faster",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed falling in a certain boss room respawning the player in a pit again",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed a cracked wall from Hemlock Citadel not being saved as destroyed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed killing an enemy and existing its screen at the same time resetting the enemy to idle but still inactive",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "hide a certain secret room from the minimap (it was too obvious)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed falling in the first room of Vesper Mines pushing the player back to Ashmoor Dunes after respawn",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "made Cannon Ball interact with bomb traps",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "added one more sound to the Worm enemy just before popping out the ground",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "coop: make players not collide with each other (it was a bit funny but there were too many edge cases where that would get the players stuck)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "coop: fixed Player 2 missing a sprite during spin attack",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "coop: fixed dead Player 1 going to a new area when Player 2 entered in a new area",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "coop: add Player 2 on minimap",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed CRT filter causing blurred sprites in some very specific positions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "some performance optimizations: Notes on purple block pattern puzzle: now each block can only be hit once. The bad news is that this required changing the puzzle solution in a few places so if you look up an old guide/video you may see an outdated solution, the good news is that this should make it a bit easier to solve the puzzle on your own. All of the puzzle clues told the player about the order of a block in the solution, for some reason a lot of players kept trying to hit the same block multiple times even though that is never the solution in the game, I saw players try this strategy still at the last puzzle in the game even though this was never a solution, resulting in a lot of time lost. Now each block can only be hit once so this should prevent the player from brute forcing a solution that takes a lot of time to input and never works.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
