  {
   "id": "tearscape-318752@major-2025-10-21",
   "gameId": "tearscape-318752",
   "displayName": "Demo Update (Next Fest Feedback)",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-10-21T18:03:10.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The game managed to get quite a bit of attention which makes me very happy. I'm also very grateful for all the feedback everyone provided, I read everything you all say and take it very seriously.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I just released a new update for the demo taking into account some of the changes you all requested.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Changelog",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Character walking too slow: now you can run! Press and hold the roll button to start a roll that continues into running. This should help a lot with with some longer runbacks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Healing animation is faster",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Buffed Revolver: bullet is faster and does more damage",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nerfed Bug enemy: attacks slower and is constrained to a certain range",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nerfed Skeleton enemy: after a few attacks it will go into a repositioning state",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nerfed the Bat enemy: slightly slower attack speed plus it attacks only from horizontal/vertical axes, no longer from diagonal positions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Seraph balance: slightly lower health and attack power",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changed Seraph attack where he drops rocks from the ceiling: they had a shadow implying they are in the air but it would hurt the player on touch. Now they will no longer hurt the player but cause a very small explosion when landing on the ground",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nyxclaw balance: slightly lower health",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Slightly smaller collision box for the spikes trap",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed stamina not regenerating while healing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some doors getting the player stuck in the wall",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "When pausing the game the music fades to a lower volume instead of stopping",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Multi-display setups: you can choose which display to use in the Video settings",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That's all for now. Please give this new update a chance and let me know how does it feel. Keep playing the demo and keep the feedback coming!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
